---
// Approved Living Systems composition; native Astro, no client framework.
import EmailInvitation from './EmailInvitation.astro';
---
<section class="ls-manifesto-chapter" id="begin">
<header class="ls-chapter-heading ls-container">
<p class="ls-eyebrow">05 / The invitation</p>
<h2>GIVE ONE PAGE ITS <span class="ls-stroke">NEXT LIFE.</span>
</h2>
</header>
<div class="ls-story-unit" data-tone="paper">
<div class="ls-container">
<div class="ls-principle-pair">
<article class="ls-principle" data-principle="true" id="one-page">
<span class="ls-principle-index">17 /</span>
<h3>TRY THE SECOND CYCLE.</h3>
<p>The first result is a demonstration. The second cycle is the test. Did the document stay useful? Was the change easy to understand? Could you recover? Did the routine ask for less of your attention?</p>
</article>
<article class="ls-principle" data-principle="true" id="start-now">
<span class="ls-principle-index">18 /</span>
<h3>TAKE THE METHOD WITH YOU.</h3>
<p>Download Flow. Give one page a purpose, a bounded routine and a way to review the result. Try the next cycle. Make room for the project, question or possibility you keep postponing.</p>
</article>
</div>
<div class="ls-story-visual">
<figure aria-label="The second cycle is the test" class="ls-scene ls-second-cycle-scene" data-frame="0" data-scene="true" data-scene-count="3">
<div class="ls-scene-chrome">
<span>
<i>
</i>
<i>
</i>
<i>
</i>
</span>
<b>The second cycle is the test</b>
<span>FLOW / ILLUSTRATION</span>
</div>
<div class="ls-scene-body">
<div class="ls-cycle-layout">
<div class="ls-cycle-first">
<span class="ls-v5-label">FIRST CYCLE</span>
<h3>Make it useful.</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check" fill="none" height="17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5">
</path>
</svg> Pick one recurring brief</li>
<li>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check" fill="none" height="17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5">
</path>
</svg> Name sources and a job</li>
<li>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check" fill="none" height="17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5">
</path>
</svg> Inspect the first result</li>
</ul>
<p>The first result shows what is possible.</p>
</div>
<div class="ls-cycle-arrow">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw" fill="none" height="29" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="29" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8">
</path>
<path d="M3 3v5h5">
</path>
</svg>
<span>RETURN</span>
</div>
<div class="ls-cycle-second">
<span class="ls-v5-label">SECOND CYCLE</span>
<h3>See if it stays useful.</h3>
<div class="ls-cycle-choices">
<button aria-pressed="true" data-scene-select="0" type="button">Changed</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" data-scene-select="1" type="button">No change</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" data-scene-select="2" type="button">Attention</button>
</div>
<div data-scene-panel="0">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-chart-column" fill="none" height="30" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16">
</path>
<path d="M18 17V9">
</path>
<path d="M13 17V5">
</path>
<path d="M8 17v-3">
</path>
</svg>
<b>The view caught up.</b>
<p>Check the source, understand the change, make your decision.</p>
</div>
<div data-scene-panel="1" hidden="">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check" fill="none" height="30" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5">
</path>
</svg>
<b>Nothing needed rewriting.</b>
<p>The routine ran without manufacturing another thing to read.</p>
</div>
<div data-scene-panel="2" hidden="">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-circle-alert" fill="none" height="30" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10">
</circle>
<line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="12">
</line>
<line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="16" y2="16">
</line>
</svg>
<b>The exception is visible.</b>
<p>A missing source leaves an explanation, not an invented answer.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p class="ls-scene-note">The measure is your next return: useful work, clear changes, a way back and less attention demanded.</p>
</div>
<figcaption class="ls-scene-controls">
<span class="ls-scene-status">
<span data-scene-caption="0">Changed / useful upkeep with a readable result</span>
<span data-scene-caption="1" hidden="">No change / a quiet outcome worth keeping</span>
<span data-scene-caption="2" hidden="">Needs attention / an exception you can understand</span>
</span>
<span>
<button aria-label="Next step: The second cycle is the test" data-scene-next="true" type="button">Next <svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
<button aria-label="Replay: The second cycle is the test" data-scene-replay="true" type="button">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw" fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8">
</path>
<path d="M3 3v5h5">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
</span>
</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="ls-manifesto-starter">
<div class="ls-container"><EmailInvitation /></div>
</div>
</section>
